romo codes - and then text like the checkbox for mobile nr  on font:  use cents in checkout (and bag, mini bag)  PDP/PLP we dont use cents, everything is always rounded  **02-07:** For delivery purposes needs to be unchecked by default - need to think about this later, for now checked.  if you continue as a guest - you don’t get a code - you just need to give email.  put mobile in the form with checkbox for delivery purposes - only email field at the top  for mobile - country code + number 2 boxes.  mobile at the bottom of delivery fields - checkbox on the right  other text (country finding help, cannot delivery to PO boxes)  in dropdown- can we have 3 addresses. Don't need state/postal code when searching  **07-07:** marketing does not want apple login - need Rebecca to connect with marketing |\n| 7 | [Checkout Flow & Delivery](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-12) | **Delivery Address** | Google address autocomplete; billing address (same-as-shipping toggle); address validation errors (PO Box/parcel locker block) | Sprint 3 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=1800-58176&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | PENDINGYellow | PendingYellow |  | **01-07:** is there a version of the billing address fields? Charmaine to make one version of checkout with this |\n| 7 | [Checkout Flow & Delivery](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-12) | **Delivery Method** | Narvar EDD display; free-shipping threshold; Collect-in-Boutique store selector (map + list, store detail, name fields); collect-in-boutique unavailable-item handling | Sprint 3 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=1800-58176&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | PENDINGYellow | PendingYellow | **01-07:** Collect in boutique does not look clickable, to be checked if intended? looks like header format now |  |\n| 7 | [Checkout Flow & Delivery](https://zimmermannwor